=== Analytic Lipschitz constants (Fix 1) ===
  zero-chain : L = 2.0
    F = 0.5||x||^2 + (0.1/d)*sum_k exp(-x_k^2/0.1)*x_{k+1}^2
    Hessian bound on B(0,0.5): max eigenvalue <= 1 + 3/d < 2  =>  L=2
  sinusoid   : L = 1.0
    F = 0.5||x||^2 + (0.1/d)*sum_k sin(x_k)
    Hessian = I - diag((0.1/d)*sin(x_k)), ||H||_2 <= 1+0.1/d < 1.01  =>  L=1

